// Editor history (v3 Task 12 split of js/app.js): a photo's settings as a snapshot, applying and restoring them, and
// one undo step per gesture through commit() / change().

// Callbacks from the modules that sit above this one (panels, preview, apply-to-selected), set once by app.js:
// restoring or changing the settings re-syncs the controls and re-renders; a commit refreshes the buttons and copies
// a live edit to the other selected photos.
// ↓ imports (generated by the v3 split; edit freely)
